From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gyuyoung Kim <qkim@google.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 02:17:19 +0000
Subject: [M150-LTS][arm64] Use MacroAssembler::Add in PopTempStackSlots

Use MacroAssembler::Add instead of raw Assembler::add in
CodeGenerator::PopTempStackSlots and
MacroAssembler::LoadStoreMacroComplex to handle immediates that cannot
be encoded in a single ADD instruction, and promote the range check in
Assembler::ImmAddSub to a CHECK.

TAG=agy

Fixed: 578656106
Change-Id: I697c02790e9547a2e1aaf142b4a06ba6de95994c
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/8713383
Reviewed-by: Clemens Backes <clemensb@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Thibaud Michaud <thibaudm@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#111585}
(cherry picked from commit e6031048e7e5119f9fa89d569b221c13d16452a0)

